  "id": "nonadherence",
  "term": "nonadherence",
  "definition": "Nonadherence is not following a prescribed medication plan as intended. In this context, it refers to antidepressant use being disrupted in everyday practice, often because of worries about long-term effects, difficulty tolerating side effects, or social and cultural influences.",
